"Allow Device Control and Data Access…" = "允许设备控制和数据访问…"
"Done" = "完成"
"Lets Rolltop see which items are in the menu bar, and hide or open them." = "让 Rolltop 看到菜单栏中有哪些项，并隐藏或打开它们。"
"Shows the real icons of hidden items. You can skip this: Rolltop then shows app icons." = "显示隐藏项的真实图标。可以跳过：Rolltop 会改为显示 App 图标。"
"Step 1" = "第 1 步"
"Step 2, optional" = "第 2 步（可选）"
"Rolltop hides the menu bar items you don’t need all the time. Click its icon in the menu bar to bring them back." = "Rolltop 会隐藏你不常用的菜单栏项。\n点按菜单栏中的 Rolltop 图标即可让它们重新出现。"
"Welcome to Rolltop" = "欢迎使用 Rolltop"
"You can allow it later in Settings › Permissions." = "你可以稍后在“设置 › 权限”中允许。"
